      <ul>
        <li><strong>Weekly:</strong> Automated offsite database backups and uptime heartbeats.</li>
        <li><strong>Monthly:</strong> Security vulnerability audits, CMS/plugin dependency patches, and broken link scans.</li>
        <li><strong>Quarterly:</strong> Full end-to-end checkout flow audits, speed benchmarks, and search console health reviews.</li>
      </ul>
